vczh Coda plugin

The upstream/ directory reproduces shared workflow prompts, guidelines,
scripts and templates from vczh-libraries/Tools, Copilot/, by vczh and
contributors, at commit 493f3fe00b4a48831c1cc0612184fde709bafcb2.
The original file contents are unchanged; upstream/manifest.json lists hashes.

Upstream: https://github.com/vczh-libraries/Tools
Licensing statement: https://github.com/vczh-libraries/License/blob/master/README.md

Changes outside upstream/ include classification by language and applicability,
Chinese navigation labels, project prompt management, a cross-platform archive
helper, and Coda workflow and panel integration. These host integration features
are not represented as original upstream features.

This plugin is not an official vczh project or an endorsement by the authors.
The three reference repositories' product code and project knowledge bodies
are not distributed with this plugin.
